WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Explore the editable garden-house scene. This is a deterministic synthetic-input tutorial.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Draw a short detail on the front plane and watch the stroke build.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Select the new stroke, move it, then undo and redo the transform.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Orbit the camera to inspect the drawing in depth.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Save the native document through the production save path.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Reopen the saved native document through the production open path. The scene remains editable; input is synthetic with no pressure data.
